OL,3,GNEWSAVandals target ancient stones in
OL,4,A'heritage crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGold paint has been removed from
OL,7,Fstanding stones believed to be about
OL,8,F4,500 years old after an act of
OL,9,Fvandalism.
OL,11,FThe National Trust reported the
OL,12,Fincident to police and removed the
OL,13,Fsubstance from the Neolithic Avebury
OL,14,FWorld Heritage site in Wiltshire
OL,15,Fearlier. It is believed to have been
OL,16,Fvandalised overnight.
OL,18,FContaining three stone circles and
OL,19,Foriginally boasting 100 huge standing
OL,20,Fstones, Avebury has been the subject of
OL,21,Fconsiderable archaeological interest
OL,22,Fsince the 17th Century.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
