OL,3,GNEWSAVandals target ancient stones in
OL,4,A'heritage crime'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the National Trust
OL,7,Fsaid: "The substance that was on the
OL,8,Fstones has been successfully removed by
OL,9,Four team and we are confident there has
OL,10,Fbeen no lasting damage."
